  recoveryNotes: SRMD graph timing and CFX Spine layering are data-derived. Particle
    emitter parameters are translated, but shared SCT particle textures use a generated
    soft fallback. Masks, custom shaders, color-blend and post-process nodes remain
    diagnostic markers. Negative/sentinel CFX scales use a positive preview fallback,
    ancillary Spine Bezier keys are sampled with linear interpolation, and only the
    primary cam/camera/node bone is sampled from multi-bone ancillary skeletons.
  unresolvedResources:
  - 'Shared particle texture approximated with soft fallback: particle/cross_01.sct'
  - 'Shared particle texture approximated with soft fallback: particle/cross_06.sct'
  - 'Shared particle texture approximated with soft fallback: particle/glass_05.sct'
  - 'Shared particle texture approximated with soft fallback: particle/pati_03.sct'
